Preface sqldf with fn$ as in Example 5 on the home page
  https://code.google.com/p/sqldf/#Example_5._Insert_Variables
Also see ?fn

Here, we would have:

b <- 1
c <- 980
data <- fn$sqldf("select date, a, b, c where c=$c and
                     b=$b", row.names=TRUE)

